# Tracker op logs. Kept here (not only at the repo root) so a standalone
# `pip install hypergumbo-tracker` in a repo without hypergumbo's root
# .gitattributes still gets union-merge and readable diffs.
#
# merge=union is load-bearing per ADR-0013: append-only ops + nonce-on-every-line
# make concurrent appends conflict-free.
#
# diff=tracker MUST match the repo-root declaration. These nested files win over
# the root pattern by path specificity, so naming a different driver here makes
# the root one dead configuration -- which is exactly how the driver stayed
# broken while looking configured.
*.ops merge=union
*.ops diff=tracker
